   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"page-hero page-hero--plain\" aria-labelledby=\"page-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <ol class=\"breadcrumb\"><li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Gallery</li></ol>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Photographs</p>\n        <h1 id=\"page-title\">A look around Bentley Hotel</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Eighteen en-suite bedrooms, each a little different, in a sandstone house built in 1874.</p>\n        <div class=\"btn-row\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"book.html\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/></svg>Check availability</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"rooms.html\">About the rooms</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--tight\" aria-labelledby=\"intro-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split split--wide-text\">\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">About these photographs</p>\n            <h2 id=\"intro-title\">The rooms as our guests find them</h2>\n            <p>These are photographs of our own bedrooms. Bentley Hotel is a Victorian house, so the rooms vary in shape and size, and we&rsquo;ve decorated each one a little differently. What they all share is the essentials: an en-suite bathroom, a TV, tea and coffee making facilities and free WiFi.</p>\n            <p>The room you&rsquo;re given may not be the exact one pictured for its type. If a bay window or a particular bed set-up matters to you, tell us when you book, or call us on <a href=\"tel:+441698265588\">01698 265588</a>, and we&rsquo;ll do our best for you.</p>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Select any photo to open it in a larger view.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <dl class=\"info-list\">\n              <div><dt>Bedrooms</dt><dd>18, all en suite</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Room types</dt><dd><a href=\"rooms.html#single\">Single</a>, <a href=\"rooms.html#twin\">twin</a>, <a href=\"rooms.html#double\">double</a> and <a href=\"rooms.html#family\">family</a></dd></div>\n              <div><dt>The house</dt><dd>Built in 1874 as Motherwell House</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Check-in</dt><dd>From 2pm</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Check-out</dt><dd>By 11am</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Parking</dt><dd>Free, on site</dd></div>\n            </dl>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" id=\"house\" aria-labelledby=\"house-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split\">\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">The house</p>\n            <h2 id=\"house-title\">Motherwell House, from the High Road</h2>\n            <p>Bentley Hotel began as Motherwell House, a family home of 1874 which, as the story goes, was built for Colonel Black of the Cameronians. Much has changed inside since then, but the outside has kept its character: warm sandstone, a tall square tower, stepped gables and the bay windows you&rsquo;ll find in some of the bedrooms.</p>\n            <p>The glass conservatory, on the left of the photograph, was purpose-built onto the side of the restaurant. The house stands among the Victorian villas of Motherwell&rsquo;s west end, inside the Hamilton Road Conservation Area, about 5 minutes&rsquo; walk from the station.</p>\n            <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"history.html\">The story of the house <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n              <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/exterior-700.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/exterior-700.webp 700w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/exterior-700.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/exterior-700.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"700\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Bentley Hotel from the street: a sandstone Victorian villa with a tall square tower, stepped gables and bay windows, the glass conservatory on the left and hedges in front, under a blue sky\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n              <figcaption>The house from High Road, with the conservatory on the left.</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"double\" aria-labelledby=\"double-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Sleeps 2 adults</p>\n          <h2 id=\"double-title\">Double rooms</h2>\n          <p>A double bed for couples, or for anyone who likes a bit more space. Each of our doubles is decorated differently, and some have the bay windows that give the house its character. <a href=\"rooms.html#double\">About the double room</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--3 gallery-grid\">\n          <figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\">\n            <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-double-1-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"515\" alt=\"Double bed with a blue throw in a bright bay-windowed room, with a tall mirror, a grey armchair, a round table and the en-suite door open\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n            <figcaption>Double room with a bay window.</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\">\n            <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-double-2-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-2-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-2-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Double bed with a plum throw against a plum feature wall, with two wall lights and a white bedside table\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n            <figcaption>Double room with a plum feature wall.</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\">\n            <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-double-3-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-3-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-3-lg.webp 1343w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-3-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-3-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-3-lg.jpg 1343w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"596\" alt=\"Double bed with a teal throw and tartan cushions, with teal curtains, a lamp and a wall-mounted TV\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n            <figcaption>Double room with tartan cushions and a wall-mounted TV.</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
