   "html": "<section class=\"section section--sand\" id=\"twin\" aria-labelledby=\"twin-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Sleeps 2 adults</p>\n          <h2 id=\"twin-title\">Twin rooms</h2>\n          <p>Two single beds, for friends or colleagues sharing, or for guests in town for a wedding or a match at Fir Park. <a href=\"rooms.html#twin\">About the twin room</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--2 gallery-grid\">\n          <figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\">\n            <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-twin-1-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-twin-1-lg.webp 1258w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-twin-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-twin-1-lg.jpg 1258w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"636\" alt=\"Twin room with two beds with grey throws against a teal feature wall, two teal velvet armchairs, a round white table, a desk and a mirror\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n            <figcaption>Twin room with a teal feature wall and two armchairs.</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\">\n            <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Twin room with two single beds with teal throws and cushions, dark curtains, a colourful canvas on a teal wall and a radiator under the window\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n            <figcaption>Twin room with two single beds.</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
