  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"single\" aria-labelledby=\"single-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Sleeps 1 adult</p>\n          <h2 id=\"single-title\">Single rooms</h2>\n          <p>A practical room for one, with a single bed. Our singles suit contractors, business travellers and anyone visiting family in Motherwell. Both of the rooms pictured have a desk; if you need one for work, ask us when you book. <a href=\"rooms.html#single\">About the single room</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--2 gallery-grid\">\n          <figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\">\n            <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-single-1-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-single-1-lg.webp 1138w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-single-1-lg.jpg 1138w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" alt=\"Single room with a single bed with a grey throw, a white desk and grey chair, a bedside lamp, a window with patterned curtains and pink floral artwork\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n            <figcaption>Single room with a white desk and chair.</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\">\n            <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-single-2-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-single-2-lg.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-single-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-single-2-lg.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Single room with a chevron cushion and grey throw on the bed, a desk with a TV, three red artworks and the room door\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n            <figcaption>Single room with a desk and TV.</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
