   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" id=\"family\" aria-labelledby=\"family-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split\">\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n              <a class=\"media-frame media-frame--wide gallery-link\" href=\"assets/img/room-family-1-lg.jpg\" data-gallery><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-family-1-lg.webp 1334w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-family-1-lg.jpg 1334w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Family room with a double bed and a single bed in white linen, a sage-green wall and a colourful canvas\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></a>\n              <figcaption>Family room: a double bed and a single bed.</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Sleeps up to 3</p>\n            <h2 id=\"family-title\">Family room</h2>\n            <p>A double bed and a single bed in one room, so a couple with a child, or three people travelling together, can stay together. One of the three guests may be a child.</p>\n            <p>Travelling with a baby, or need an extra bed? Please call us before booking so we can talk through what&rsquo;s available for your dates.</p>\n            <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"rooms.html#family\">About the family room <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--green\" aria-labelledby=\"events-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split split--wide-text\">\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Planning an event?</p>\n            <h2 id=\"events-title\">Come and see the function suite and conservatory for yourself</h2>\n            <p>Photographs only tell you so much about a room you&rsquo;re planning to fill with family and friends. If you&rsquo;re thinking about a wedding, a party, a meeting or a family gathering, we&rsquo;d be happy to show you round the function suite, the conservatory and the restaurant, and talk through how each would work for your numbers.</p>\n            <p>Call us on <a href=\"tel:+441698265588\">01698 265588</a> to arrange a time, or send us an enquiry with your date and numbers and we&rsquo;ll come back to you.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <div class=\"btn-row\">\n              <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"weddings.html\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"/></svg>Weddings</a>\n              <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"functions.html\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>Functions &amp; meetings</a>\n              <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"contact.html?enquiry=Function\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-10 6L2 7\"/></svg>Send an enquiry</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
